# comments  (repeatable function/data comments, one per line: '# comment <addr8> <text>')
# comment 00100800 sceCdInit(0); sceCdMmode(2 = DVD); sceCdDiskReady(0); clears request list + 256-entry sCdvdCache
# comment 001008b0 path -> uppercase/backslash -> SetRofsDir(dir) -> ADXF_Open/Close probe (table lookup only, no disc read)
# comment 00100980 per-frame (kwlnUpdate) request pump, FIFO from sCdvdListFirst: state 0 ADXF_Open -> 1 RwHeapMalloc((sct<<11)+64|320) aligned to 64, ADXF_ReadNw whole file -> 2 poll ADXF_GetStat (3 done, 4 error -> retry) -> 3 H_Cdvd_AddFile -> 4 loaded. One request in flight.
