# comment 00100ec0 drops refcount; at 0 and loaded: frees buffer (unless no_free), clears owned cache entries, closes ADXF handle, frees node; busy requests defer (+860)
# comment 00101010 out = VOL:\ + path with / -> \ and a-z uppercased (255 max)
# comment 00101100 splits uppercased path into dir (with trailing backslash) and VOL:+filename
# comment 00101240 dir normalized; if dir is in g_tbl_rofsDirNames_BTL the file gets prefix BTL: else VOL: (route = top-level directory)
# comment 001013f0 removes .\ and ..\ components
# comment 00101520 dir string (after VOL:) strcmp'd against g_tbl_rofsDirNames_BTL then _VOL; ROFS_SetDir(BTL/VOL, matching #DirLst# table) with retry loop; prints SetDir Error / rofs err %d
